Matrix convexity covers every intermediate $a_k$.
The source-derived charge is strictly below $.006(.00027)/2$.
The inverse metric is
$G^{-1}=\left[\begin{smallmatrix}3/25&1/25\\1/25&2/25\end{smallmatrix}\right]$,
giving $|e|<.0021$, $|i|<.00017$. The Euler norm identity, with a conservative
