\[
 B_x\ge75(1-u)(1-a_*^2/2),\quad |B_z|\le75(1+u)a_*,\quad
 \|B\|\le75(1+u).
\]
For the exact-real unrounded magnetic record the factors $1\pm u$ disappear,
