target-3 floor. This order retains correction--prediction--pending-sync
chronology. Direct rational substitution, or (OF3)--(OF4), gives
\[
 \begin{gathered}
 \frac{W_0-W_N}{\lambda}
       =-\frac{691428110973}{567390082009}<0,\\
 R_WH_W^{-1}R_W^T=
 \frac{3600981887018337723830924642750000}
 {2360546894727403698724996038046493}>1.
 \end{gathered}                                             \tag{OF7}
\]
Here $H_W\succ0$, and the root-fixed-AA tangent space has five coordinates
$(dB_{11},dB_{12},dB_{22},dT_1,dT_2)$. The offending root direction is
$(-10,3,1,0,0)$. Thus the \emph{exact coupled} Schur threshold fails even
with positive process and an optimal non-AW correction. There is no norm
product or failed isotropic sufficient replacement. The relaxation is
precisely this formal three-state process/observation; it has not been
substituted for the shipping OU process or MAGNETIC SERVICE.

\paragraph{Outcome and shipping-faithfulness record.}
Classification \textbf{D}: the existing positive-process, conditional-precision,
non-AW-correction and causal-fixed-target facts alone do not close the
identified AW regression reader. No lossless shipping impossibility or
shipping instability is asserted. The missing shipping mechanism is the
