The new exact restriction removes process-score and non-AW generated
\emph{self}-work on its stated fibre; it does not prove the full machine
flag \texttt{uniform\_generated\_packet\_absorption\_verified}.

(1) Preserved: all 21 states and both parities, actual $P/K$/Joseph, integrated
OU/BG/BA process, applied magnetic and $S$ rows, pending AW face, literal
reset/projection, complete generated suffixes and inherited histories.
(2) Relaxations: qualified regular real A21 planar partial derivative with
