Exact-rational regressions verify these entries; the preceding derivation is
the proof.

\subsection{Correlated endogenous gap and the causal AW-deficit reader}
\label{app:correlated-complete-gap}

\paragraph{Six questions, and the controlling test.}
(1) The starting balance is (LR8), with (LR9)'s actual correlated
lift, and the target is its homogeneous gap
$G\succeq c\mathcal J_{\perp,0}$, $c>0$, uniformly on activated
service-qualified words. (2) The attacked term is the signed AW-face
covariance work inside that gap, including its inherited root and coefficient
dependence, rather than an independent maximum of $E_L$.
(3) The calculation below is inserted into (OF1)'s actual prefixes and its
already-qualified odd-covariance partial block (OF4).
(4) It eliminates an independent AW-marginal tangent from that partial
block: its face deficit derivative is an exact causal sum of the same
corrections' information-decrement readers. It also prevents inherited
endogenous work from being moved to external supply.
(5) The required threshold remains the relative Schur test for the full
$G-c\mathcal J_{\perp,0}$; on (OF4), it is (OF5)'s threshold one,
with a common strict reserve and coercivity. (6) The new receipt is
substituted below and the resulting Schur relaxation is tested analytically.
It reduces the unresolved partial operator to actual correction readers
and target/coefficient ports, but does \emph{not} discharge a full-word
OPEN dependency. A reader identity by itself is not a contraction theorem.

\paragraph{Causal origin before the block partition.}
Let $a_0$ be the actual inherited auxiliary tangent in (LR2), including
reference, frontend/variance/frequency, staged tuner, scheduler, pending
AW target, bias mode and source histories. A fixed regular word has the
literal causal linear recursion obtained by differentiating its shipping
operations. Source columns are derivatives of one admissible physical and
delivered history, including its SLOW/FAST and primitive constraints.
They are not arbitrary independent values of $a_0$ or of each event port.
When that recursion proves
$da_0=\Lambda v_0+A_d d$, insert $\mathsf R_a\Lambda$ in
$\mathsf M_{\rm lift}$, and $\mathsf R_aA_d d$ in the source reader.
If a graph is not proved, retain the endogenous part of $da_0$ in an
augmented root. The coordinate $d$ contains \emph{only} genuine admissible
exogenous variation. The locked-Live zero reverse edge (LR1) does not
justify $\Lambda=0$ or externalization of inherited endogenous variation.
Past physical forcing may explain an auxiliary column only through its
actual inherited causal history map. No history is restarted.

There is a necessary check if the augmented stored-root Gram $J_r$ is
semidefinite. Let $T_{N,e}$ be the complete homogeneous terminal map,
and $J_{\perp,N}$ the justified transverse terminal metric. Positivity
$G\succeq cJ_r$ requires
\[
 u\in\ker J_r\quad\Longrightarrow\quad
 J_{\perp,N}^{1/2}T_{N,e}u=0.                              \tag{CR1}
\]
Indeed, otherwise the exact gap on $(u,0)$ is strictly negative, although
its initial stored energy is zero. This is a test of the \emph{chosen
causal root family}, not a claim that arbitrary independent auxiliary
variations are shipping reachable. An unproved inherited graph cannot
be repaired by declaring those columns to be disturbance or by deleting
them. Neither (CR1) nor a source-origin qualification is established for
the entire shipping family here.

\paragraph{One matrix, including the endpoint gauge.}
Use the existing complete prefix map $T_i$ in (OF1), now partitioned
$T_i=[T_{i,e},T_{i,d}]$ on $z=(v_0,d)$ after the preceding causal-origin
qualification. Pull the \emph{same} endpoint gauge subenergy back to
these coordinates, denoting its Gram by $\Gamma_i$.
It may have root/source cross entries. Define
\[
 \begin{split}
 I_i&=T_i^T\mathcal J_iT_i-\Gamma_i,\\
 Q_W&=G_{action}-G_{port}-\Gamma_0+\Gamma_N
          =I_0-I_N
          =\begin{pmatrix}G&H\\H^T&-S\end{pmatrix}.
 \end{split}                                               \tag{CR2}
\]
Then the exact tangent balance is $W_{\perp,0}-W_{\perp,N}=z^TQ_Wz$.
In particular $G=(I_0-I_N)_{ee}$, $H=(I_0-I_N)_{ed}$,
$S=(I_N-I_0)_{dd}$: no positive source supply or sign for $S$ is
asserted before this partition is justified.
On (LR9)'s graph this specializes to
$G=\mathcal J_0-\mathsf M_{\rm lift}^T\mathcal J_N
\mathsf M_{\rm lift}-\Gamma_{0,ee}+\Gamma_{N,ee}$ and
$H=-\mathsf M_{\rm lift}^T\mathcal J_N F_d
-\Gamma_{0,ed}+\Gamma_{N,ed}$, when the initial source columns vanish.
Otherwise retain all entries of $I_0$.

Evaluate (CR2) by (OF1),(OF1a), not frozen-factor products. It includes
process information and covariance Fisher loss, integrated OU/AW loss,
actual recurring $S$ and applied magnetic loss and the qualified $9/10$
linked magnetic result only on its stated stratum. (CP4) pays complementary
base propagation once. (CA1)--(CA8) and (CM1)--(CM8) supply the conditional
blocks and actual $(C,T,q)$ reader, with cross precision retained.
(WS5)--(WS6) retain generated $U_iq_{i+1,N}$; (PS5)--(PS8) retain
$E_L+S_q-2C_W$ with the generated process cross and square.
The AW row/frame coboundary, held-BA endpoint and fixed-input even-process
results remove only their stated charges. Reset/projection, $dK r$,
$dH,dR,dr$, physical OU/$S$/bias mismatch, source/reference and gauge work,
refinement yaw and unqualified reacquisition remain. The moving-projector
derivative used for physical distance is first-order work, not a discarded
nonlinear remainder. Fixed-word differentiability does not prove scheduler
branch retention or target arithmetic.

After forming this matrix, $d=0$ leaves \emph{all} endogenous lift columns.
For a justified conditional/complementary partition of $G-cJ_r$,
\[
 G-cJ_r=\begin{pmatrix}A&X\\X^T&N\end{pmatrix},\qquad
 N\succ0,\quad A-XN^{-1}X^T\succeq0                       \tag{CR3}
\]
is the exact relative Schur condition. Separate positivity of $A,N$
does not suffice. Physical magnetic-service probes remain transported
through this same causal $T_i$. A two-column service floor does not
supply (CR3) on all mean, covariance and inherited auxiliary directions.

\paragraph{Return to the literal generator of the AW work.}
On the qualified regular central-planar odd-covariance fibre of (OF2),
write $a=AW_y$, $p=P_{aa}$, $\alpha^f$ for the \emph{queued} floor
target and $q_{aa}$ for the \emph{actually applied} process entry.
The scalar shipping AW row is $F_{ao}=0,F_{aa}=\phi$; hence
\[
 \begin{array}{ll}
 p^-=\phi^2p+q_{aa},&
 D_{aa}^-=\phi^2D_{aa}+2\phi\,d\phi\,p+dq_{aa},\\
 p^+=p-I_a,\quad I_a=b^2/s,&
 dI_a=2b\,db/s-b^2\,ds/s^2,
 \end{array}                                               \tag{CR4}
\]
at a scalar correction, where $b=(Ph^T)_a$, $s=hPh^T+R$.
The odd acc, magnetic and $S$ channels use their actual rows and noises.
Attitude reset and bias projection have unchanged AA covariance row on
this qualified fibre; other branches/repairs must keep their actual ports.
In \texttt{IntegratedOUChain<T,2>::process\_covariance}, the small-step
AA entry is a degree-nine polynomial, followed by PSD regularization.
Consequently do \emph{not} replace $q_{aa}$ universally by
$(1-\phi^2)\sigma^2$. All integrated process blocks stay in (OF1).

Between two \emph{actual active} floor events, let $w_j$ be the product
of all subsequent prediction factors $\phi^2$ up to the next pre-face
boundary, with $w_0$ the full product. Expansion of the literal AA row
gives
\[
 \begin{split}
 p_N^-&=w_0\alpha_0^f+
             \sum_{\rm pred}w_jq_{aa,j}
             -\sum_{\rm corr}w_j I_{a,j},\\
 \Delta_N&=\alpha_N^f-p_N^-
             =D_{\rm sched}+\sum_{\rm corr}w_j I_{a,j},\\
 D_{\rm sched}&=\alpha_N^f-w_0\alpha_0^f
                         -\sum_{\rm pred}w_jq_{aa,j},\\
 \mu_N&=D_{aa,N}^- -d\alpha_N^f\\
 &=w_0d\alpha_0^f+
       \sum_{\rm pred}w_j(2\phi_jd\phi_jp_j+dq_{aa,j})
       -\sum_{\rm corr}w_jdI_{a,j}-d\alpha_N^f .
 \end{split}                                               \tag{CR5}
\]
The local $2\phi d\phi p$ terms already differentiate the causal weights;
do not differentiate $w_j$ a second time in this tangent formula.
Before the first active face replace $\alpha_0^f,d\alpha_0^f$ by the
actual inherited $p_0,D_{aa,0}$. Inactive faces leave that history intact.
The wrapper commits a staged tuner before prediction, whereas a pending
floor was queued at the previous covariance-maintenance event. Their
targets need not agree. Thus $D_{\rm sched}$ is signed, not deleted,
nor independently bounded by a Cartesian tuner box.

For the fixed-input/private \emph{partial covariance} variation, after
an actual fixed-target active face $D_{aa,0}=0$ and $d\phi=dq_{aa}
=d\alpha^f=0$. Equation (CR5) then proves the nontrivial substitution
$\mu_N=-\sum_{\rm corr}w_jdI_{a,j}$.
It does not set these ports to zero on a correlated auxiliary/root lift.
On that lift each term of (CR5) is partitioned by its actual causal origin
and inserted into (CR2), including inherited target and tuner work.

\paragraph{Exact directional payment by the same correction.}
Separate only the algebraic covariance and row/noise parts,
not their causal origins:
\[
 \begin{split}
 dI_a&=r_a(D)+\pi_a,\\
 r_a(D)&=2b(Dh^T)_a/s-b^2(hDh^T)/s^2,\\
 \pi_a&=2b(P\,dh^T)_a/s
          -b^2(2\,dh\,Ph^T+dR)/s^2 .
 \end{split}
\]
Put $K=2J-h^Th/s\succ0$, $\ell=2e_a-(b/s)h^T$.
The actual scalar Fisher loss (OF4a) is
$L_P=(Dh^T)^TK(Dh^T)/s$, and
$r_a=(b/\sqrt{s})\ell^T(Dh^T/\sqrt{s})$.
Sherman--Morrison gives
$K^{-1}=P/2+Ph^ThP/[2(s+R)]$, whence direct cancellation yields
\[
 \boxed{\ell^TK^{-1}\ell=2p-I_a,\qquad
 r_a(D)^2\le I_a(2p-I_a)L_P
                 =[p^2-(p-I_a)^2]L_P.}                    \tag{CR6}
\]
This constant is sharp on symmetric covariance tangents for $h\ne0$:
every vector $v=Dh^T$ is realized by a symmetric $D$, in particular
$v=K^{-1}\ell$. If $b=0$, both $I_a$ and $r_a$ vanish.
The signed $\pi_a$ remains a causal coefficient port; it is neither
paid by (CR6) nor automatically external.

For non-AW $S$/magnetic rows use (CA2) quantitatively:
$B^+=(B^{-1}+h_o^TR^{-1}h_o)^{-1}$, $C^+=C,T^+=T$.
Writing $\delta B=B-B^+$, the \emph{same} correction satisfies
\[
 \begin{split}
 I_a&=T\delta B T^T,\\
 dI_a&=T(dB-dB^+)T^T+2dT\,\delta B T^T,\\
 L_{\rm cov,actual}&=\operatorname{tr}(B^{-1}dB B^{-1}dB)
   -\operatorname{tr}((B^+)^{-1}dB^+(B^+)^{-1}dB^+)
   +2dT\,\delta B\,dT^T/C .
 \end{split}                                               \tag{CR7}
\]
Here row/noise variation stays inside the actual $dB^+$ and its signed
ports. Only the fixed-row/noise version of this decrement is the
nonnegative $L_P$ in (CR6), with $dB^+=A_o dB A_o^T$; the difference
remains signed work in (OF1).
Thus recurring $S$ and applied magnetic action supply directional
regression and covariance payment with the same $T,B,h,R$ and chronology,
not merely a weakest scalar service eigenvalue. The acc row, which
observes AW itself, uses (CR6) with its full actual row.

\paragraph{Insert the receipt into the signed face block.}
With $\beta=TBT^T$, $C=p-\beta$, $C^+=C+\Delta$,
set $q=dC/C$, $a=C/C^+$ and $\mu=D_{aa}-d\alpha^f$.
The actual face gives $dC^+=dC-\mu$, including target variation.
The \emph{same} Fisher part of its gap is therefore
\[
 \begin{split}
 L_{\rm face}
 &=q^2-(a q-\mu/C^+)^2+
             2(1/C-1/C^+)dT B dT^T\\
 &=(1-a^2)\left(q+\frac{a\mu}{C^+(1-a^2)}\right)^2
       +2(1/C-1/C^+)dT B dT^T
       -\frac{\mu^2}{\Delta(2C+\Delta)} .
 \end{split}                                               \tag{CR8}
\]
This is completion of the actual signed block, not a new storage.
On every actual root/source column use (CR5) for $\mu$ \emph{before}
polarizing (CR8). Sum the ordinary process/acc/$S$/magnetic Fisher
Grams and these exact face Grams on the actual prefixes. This reproduces
(OF4) exactly on its qualified partial fibre; all other entries of (CR2)
remain. In particular, the negative row is now generated by the actual
innovation derivatives, coefficient/target ports and inherited receipt,
rather than an independent auxiliary energy.

The completion must not discard $q$--$\mu$ correlation. At $\Delta=0$
its denominators are invalid; use the first line and actual directional
face map. No uniform active-face gap or differentiable crossing is assumed.

\paragraph{Attempted Schur payment, failure, and the omitted link.}
For the fixed-covariance partial receipt, temporarily enlarge the image
by freeing $q$ and the individual loss coordinates.
Using (CR6) to minimize $\sum_j L_{P,j}$ at fixed
$\mu=-\sum_jw_jr_{a,j}$, the released-coordinate Schur condition is
\[
 \sum_j w_j^2 I_{a,j}(2p_j-I_{a,j})
                 \le \Delta(2C+\Delta).                  \tag{CR9}
\]
This is \emph{not} an independent supremum of shipping parameters:
its operands are those of the same word. But it is a sufficient
relaxation because it deletes shared-tangent and conditional correlations
and leaves other process/regression action unpaid. Its structural failure
is already visible with one non-AW correction and fixed target
$p_0=\alpha$, followed by a face, without intervening process.
Here $\Delta=I_a$, $p=\alpha-I_a$, $\beta=T B^+T^T>0$, $C=p-\beta$,
and the attempted relative charge is exactly
\[
 \frac{I_a(2\alpha-I_a)}{I_a(2C+I_a)}
      =\frac{2\alpha-I_a}{2\alpha-I_a-2\beta}>1.            \tag{CR10}
\]
No scalar tightening of (CR6) can repair this test: its constant is sharp.
The released negative direction is the same-operation Fisher reader
$Dh^T\parallel K^{-1}\ell$, together with
$q=-a\mu/[C^+(1-a^2)]$, with regression variation provisionally free.
It mixes complementary covariance and AW cross-regression; this is
\emph{not} a proved root direction of a reached shipping word.

Classification \textbf{D}: (CR10) invalidates only that Schur relaxation.
The loss removed by releasing $q,r_a$ is visible in the literal equations
(CR7): $dI_a$ and $dC=D_{aa}-d(TBT^T)$ come from the same $dB,dT$.
Returning to those equations and substituting (CR5),(CR7) in (CR8)
retains that link, including the actual integrated process, acc and
rotating service directions. One cannot demand zero response to
physical forcing, but this fixed-private covariance reader is endogenous
and cannot be made external supply. Nor does (CR10) show that the
shipping linked Schur remainder fails.

The exact unresolved partial operator is now the stacked causal
